# {{.Name}}

A [Mithril](https://github.com/mithril-framework/mithril) application.

```bash
docker compose up -d postgres    # or point DB_* in .env at your own PostgreSQL
go run . migrate up
go run . createsuperuser
go run .                         # http://localhost:4000 · /docs · /admin
```

Add a resource with CRUD API, OpenAPI docs, permissions and an admin page:

```bash
mithril make:resource Post title:string:required body:text --owner
go run . migrate up
```

Build a single self-contained binary with `make build`, or a container with `docker build .`.
